"%1$s ends at the first-test-positive subgroup: P(disease | Test 1 positive) "
"= %2$.1f%%. That is not the pooled final-positive figure in the tables, "
"combined PPV = %3$.1f%%, which also averages in the Test 1 negative / Test 2 "
